{"time": 1766325838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136558045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“有些饿了，今天要去买点食材吧”"}
{"time": 1766325855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1342297533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "夜鸦醒来倒是一副神清气爽的样子"}
{"time": 1766325865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1435084295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "虽然还是和以前一样阴暗"}
{"time": 1766325965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331112527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看看安娜醒没醒，没醒就推门出去，\"昨晚没怎么睡好。\"揉揉眼睛"}
{"time": 1766325983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117386697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“有什么状况吗”"}
{"time": 1766325991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548981093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "安娜也醒了，就是睡得不怎么舒服"}
{"time": 1766326030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "722714389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（说起来要是睡得不舒服，是不是睡相会比较差来着，比如你们俩晚上互相肿击什么的）"}
{"time": 1766326096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481181738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=5D6D1BDBFC7512F225EF8752ECD44F96.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTAju8lSMlplRS1GckRSzn3gDoHZhikzAUg_woopMGJvO3OkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQE-GHgkq-hp35vlEjCOofMXoC-nCCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMAscbBF-1lU6krPtpxBsYA3n4MjH-k32Fzo09ofBEv26w21bl-qO_1rmkl8_gX1qYg,file_size=91684]"}
{"time": 1766326116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1930078828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过床铺感觉不合适，睡的腰酸背痛的”"}
{"time": 1766326124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "15429252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“过一会吃些什么吗”"}
{"time": 1766326129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322130138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（你一个睡沙发的，有什么好说床垫）"}
{"time": 1766326147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708371369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（我不是睡房间吗）"}
{"time": 1766326156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112635672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（唉，又是睡沙发呀）"}
{"time": 1766326161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013176093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"月亮如我们所料。\""}
{"time": 1766326168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067422040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“月亮怎么了”"}
{"time": 1766326189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586759341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打着哈欠，\"不是真的...但是有些过分了，红色的血月，蠕行的触手，好恶心。\""}
{"time": 1766326210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "925561082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“？触手？这是什么鬼畜东西”"}
