{"time": 1766329550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338607543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“唉，不可能，这又不是个人店，我这也就是个站台面的，就别为难我了”"}
