{"time": 1766375497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226964443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "她有些无语的用视线扫了你们一圈“什么事情，我离开血根骑士团已经很久了”"}
{"time": 1766375653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010360434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"最近，看见了月亮。\"如此开口，\"并不是这个假的月亮，是背后的那个...\""}
{"time": 1766375692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864506241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“女士，放心，我们不是那个啥骑士团的人，只是想要知道一些东西，比如说月亮”"}
{"time": 1766375711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984453279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我估且还是有看新闻的”她在没有接下后头继续等着你们说"}
{"time": 1766375846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23594350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"血月。\"自己也不知道更多的内容了，\"这几天都因为这件事没睡好。\""}
{"time": 1766376032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832928506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你们也能看到月亮的真貌......不过很遗憾，我也不清楚具体状况，过去的血根骑士团只是个可怜的受害者组织罢了”"}
{"time": 1766376118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133343193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“至少在我离开的时候是这样”她说着又补充了一句"}
{"time": 1766376120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897191202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woo_dqQ6afQkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQT0dOpuv6WeoUJY6pU8e-S3oCmWmCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSML8YGNQBi0f4665LXmqTcFjNpJXS5nNqAF-3dyTC5RSEYL5ndGJimDxD2mw0EAplWg,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1766376209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105117712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森盘腿坐在她的对面“店长，可以请教一下你的名字吗”"}
{"time": 1766376274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312650459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真貌?\"皱眉，\"到底发生了什么？\""}
{"time": 1766376385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532899775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我问过其他人了，普通人能看到的只有普通月亮。其他的状况我就不清楚了”"}
{"time": 1766376413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144275894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“名字，名字的话，叫我亚麻就好了”"}
{"time": 1766376449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510565935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“亚麻你离开那个组织也有自己的想法，是因为你体内的魔力吗，我可以看见你体内的魔力并不稳定”"}
{"time": 1766376536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "771275889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“能看见不一样的月亮也未必是受害人吧？”总感觉还有什么不对劲"}
{"time": 1766376627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "840210578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“如果非要找个理由，我离开只是因为，我不认为他们能成大事”"}
{"time": 1766376632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "973528342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"比起这个，睡不好才是大问题吧?\"烦躁地摇摇头"}
{"time": 1766376645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935362178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“既然为我提供不了帮助，那就没有必要留下来”"}
{"time": 1766376699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764710278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=840210578]“emmm，你认为的大事是什么”"}
{"time": 1766376836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905580468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“谁知道呢，可能是颠覆未来公司，也可能是让我多活一天”她露出了已然无所谓的神情"}
{"time": 1766376863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833903809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=771275889]“谁知道呢”"}
{"time": 1766376871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "897828030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“既然不知道，要不要试着加入我们，或许可以给你惊喜”"}
{"time": 1766376886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1545975646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=973528342]“或许过几天就会好了吧”"}
{"time": 1766376964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352145767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我没兴趣拼死拼活，如果有什么问题你们问我就好”"}
{"time": 1766376965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742198456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"感觉引入话题差不多了，停住不说话，靠着安娜休息"}
{"time": 1766377018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62980385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“那么那个骑士团里面都成员大多是什么样子的，都会魔法吗，结构组成如何，大本营在什么地方”"}
{"time": 1766377027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211765136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“为什么他们要袭击未来公司”"}
{"time": 1766377029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876936154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“小姐是，有什么隐疾吗？魔法相关？”试探着发问"}
{"time": 1766377046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589591700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是骑士团就是未来公司啊（）"}
{"time": 1766377049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "686886162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=E592FD5383D6608D63C9200B2220843A.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQ7_nMpWs05-HY9PbQwZwHCu_kKmxicogIg_woo3unEpKvQkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQbWvC-nIFfNXtV6dmulhVLHoCQESCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSML8YGNQBi0f4665LXmqTcFjNpJXS5nNqAF-3dyTC5RSEYL5ndGJimDxD2mw0EAplWg,file_size=37148]"}
