{"time": 1766379730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68451528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:forward,id=7586543173762508727]"}
{"time": 1766379771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "432662150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1520964409]“现在的外卖都是无人机通过窗户进入室内，至少我是能接受”"}
{"time": 1766379841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171917915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#瘫“唉，一分钱难倒英雄汉”"}
{"time": 1766379857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1815930718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“现在还要靠赌博为生”"}
{"time": 1766379859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418703706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=704700993]“谁知道呢”她一副懒得管你们生死的样子“或许帮派也不错，或许去教堂那里领救济金也能过日子”"}
{"time": 1766379881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341298551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“或许也可以试试抢银行……”"}
{"time": 1766379991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198109693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过，可以这样推论吗？有魔力的人身上都有那什么，灵根？没有灵根就注定没法拥有魔力？”"}
{"time": 1766380064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1266934069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“或许吧，假如没有其他像你们一样的人”"}
{"time": 1766380178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768937198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=418703706][CQ:at,qq=961142868] “不敢相信，这个资本世界还有救济金这种东西”"}
